  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>也算是百科类站点 fandom.com 我搜索 lk99 wiki 发现这个站点的。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>月访问7.8亿，居然有73%来自于搜索引擎。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>GPT Function Calling 可以实现，自己做就行了，没必要找别人做好的</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个站每一个百科子站都用一个子域名，这是因为不同的子站之间没有关系，所以用子域名来隔离。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>naruto.fandom.com 随便点开一个子站，流量也很不错。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>如果我们想要蹭某个词的搜索量，直接假冒对方官网肯定是不行的，但是做一个百科站点就可以。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>一个百科子站，80%流量来自于搜索引擎。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>Semrush 估算的流量更多一些\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xz5u676zw5_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
